# Wall torch particles (curl, drag, stretch, minPixels and the flame's flicker): the "Red Lantern" torch
# (NW_CITY_HABOUR_PUFF_ENTRANCE, flame at 405 121 -3085) at night from 2 m, a shot and a 6 s clip.
# Run it twice with the same content: as it is (the original FIRE_MEDIUM) and with the demo layer of
# reports/content/remaster/wall-torch/particles/content (OWN_TORCH_SPARKS_DEMO and a lamp with flicker_from),
# OPENGOTHIC_FLICKER_LOG=1 logs both signals each frame. reports/content/remaster/wall-torch/README.md, "Сделано".
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
view hide animated morph
cam lift off

set time 0 0
goto pos 265 -129 -3091
cam look 250
cam world 60 229 180
wait 34
cam hold
wait 8000
set time 0 0
wait 300
shot torch-2m
wait 700
shot torch-2m-b
rec torch-2m-clip
wait 6000
stop
wait 300
